<title>POLAND: LDA JUNE NET TURNS TO PLN 48,000 LOSS.</title>
<headline>LDA JUNE NET TURNS TO PLN 48,000 LOSS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results June</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JUNE		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net loss		 0.05 vs   0.08 profit</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   0.08 vs   0.17 profit</p>
<p> Operating loss	 0.04 vs   0.18 profit</p>
